================================================================================
Note on model-generated content
================================================================================
The application source code inside runs/batch-20260613/*/*/runs/*/app/ was
generated by large language models (claude-4.6-sonnet, claude-4.6-opus,
claude-4.8-opus, gpt-5.5, gemini-3.1-pro, grok-4.3) as experimental subjects
of the study, under the frozen task specifications in specs/. It is included
as research data, exactly as shipped by each model, and is covered by the
CC BY 4.0 grant above to the extent of the compiler's rights; no claim is
made regarding rights that may or may not subsist in machine-generated
output.
